### All books
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books

### Book with reviews
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books/1

### Book with a review without text
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books/2

### Book without reviews
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books/3

### Unknown book (expect 404)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books/999

### My shelves
GET http://localhost:8080/api/shelves

### Entries on shelf 3
GET http://localhost:8080/api/shelves/3/entries

### My stats
GET http://localhost:8080/api/stats/me

### Unknown shelf (expect 404)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/shelves/999/entries

### Invalid id, not a number (expect 400)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/shelves/abc/entries

### Search Open Library
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books/search?q=tolkien

### Search with spaces
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books/search?q=lord of the rings

### Search without q (expect 400)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books/search

### Import The Hobbit (201 the first time, 200 after)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/books/import/OL27482W

### Import an unknown key (expect 404)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/books/import/OL999999999W

### Invalid key format (expect 404, never reaches Open Library)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/books/import/hello

### Put book 4 on shelf 3 (expect 201)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/shelves/3/entries
Content-Type: application/json

{ "bookId": 4 }

### Same book again (expect 409)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/shelves/3/entries
Content-Type: application/json

{ "bookId": 4 }

### Unknown book (expect 404)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/shelves/3/entries
Content-Type: application/json

{ "bookId": 999 }

### Missing bookId (expect 400 with errors)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/shelves/3/entries
Content-Type: application/json

{ }

### Broken JSON (expect 400)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/shelves/3/entries
Content-Type: application/json

{ "bookId":

### Review book 3 (expect 201)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/books/3/reviews
Content-Type: application/json

  { "rating": 4, "text": "Bleak but brilliant." }

### Review book 3 again (expect 409)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/books/3/reviews
Content-Type: application/json

{ "rating": 5 }

### Rating out of range (expect 400 with errors.rating)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/books/4/reviews
Content-Type: application/json

{ "rating": 7 }

### Missing rating (expect 400)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/books/4/reviews
Content-Type: application/json

{ }

### Unknown book (expect 404)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/books/999/reviews
Content-Type: application/json

{ "rating": 3 }